A small EasyEDA Standard board written for this test by Circuit Center (2026-10-02),
in the format KiCad's EasyEDA importer reads at commit 48f1e865216623283579984110a80210e7ccc789: a board outline,
one footprint of two pads, three tracks on two layers and two vias. KiCad's own
EasyEDA Standard samples (qa/data/pcbnew/plugins/easyeda) are CC-BY-NC-SA 3.0,
so none of them is copied here.
